On VPS Hostinger

gunicorn and nginx
nginx configuration files at
1.  /etc/nginx/sites-available/marketplace
to edit sudo nano /path/to/files/
2. /etc/nginx/sites-available/habajumla.com

To TEST nginx : sudo nginx -t
to start : sudo systemctl start nginx
TO TEST PROCESS : ps aux | grep nginx
TO CHECK ERROR LOG : sudo tail -f /var/log/nginx/error.log

gunicorn service file
 path : /etc/systemd/system/gunicorn.services



to start gunicorn

sudo systemctl start gunicorn
restart
daemon-reload

gunicorn run to test
/root/markeetplace_server/venv/bin/gunicorn --workers 3 --bind 127.0.0.1:8000 marketplace_server.wsgi:application


to permission
sudo -u www-data ls /root/markeetplace_server/static/
sudo chmod 755 /root/markeetplace_server
